"""Assemble a native PS4 diagnostic RAM root from pinned local inputs.

This new native assembler does not invoke or change the OrbStack PS4 wrappers.
It writes only explicitly selected ordinary work/output directories, never USB
media. The separate staging tool validates the selected physical drive.
"""
